# The build context is the whole repository (about 3 GB of datasets and the Unity project among it); only the server folder, the prompts and the AI word lists are sent.
*
!server/
!server/**
!prompts/
!prompts/**
!content/
!content/ai/
!content/ai/**
!content/**
!tools/
!tools/composer/
!tools/composer/**
!tools/content/
!tools/content/**
!tests/
!tests/golden/
!tests/golden/**
!docs/
!docs/research/
!docs/research/clinical_verification.md
# never into an image: secrets, local environments, tests, caches
server/.env
server/.env.*
!server/.env.example
server/.venv
server/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
